Column name: Breakpoint Type: STRING Description: arbitrary string, eg '14q32', or '9', or '?10q?11'
Sample rows:
[{'RefNo': 4169, 'CaseNo': '384', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Breakpoint': '?'}, {'RefNo': 5553, 'CaseNo': '56', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 2, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Breakpoint': '?'}, {'RefNo': 7703, 'CaseNo': '254', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 2, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Breakpoint': '?'}, {'RefNo': 8463, 'CaseNo': '43', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Breakpoint': '?'}, {'RefNo': 8473, 'CaseNo': '1B', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Breakpoint': '?'}]

